WEBVTT

00:13.280 --> 00:15.040
[shovel clanging]

00:15.840 --> 00:18.840
[ominous music]

00:22.720 --> 00:24.640
[clanging continues]

00:32.920 --> 00:34.480
[Nanno] All of us have heard

00:35.840 --> 00:39.000
countless apologies
in this beautiful world.

00:39.080 --> 00:40.960
[shovel clanging]

00:41.800 --> 00:43.560
If we make a mistake,

00:44.640 --> 00:46.080
we apologize.

00:48.800 --> 00:51.600
And yet, we still make more mistakes.

00:53.840 --> 00:59.960
Perhaps our apology is actually meant
for our next mistake.

01:01.680 --> 01:04.120
[ominous music]

01:04.720 --> 01:06.720
[theme music]

02:17.160 --> 02:20.920
[school bell rings]

02:21.800 --> 02:23.800
[tense music]

02:29.800 --> 02:31.680
Over here! I'm open! I'm open!

02:37.600 --> 02:39.600
[upbeat music]

02:45.960 --> 02:47.320
Hey, guys.

02:47.400 --> 02:49.000
[panting]

02:49.080 --> 02:50.360
[Neung] Where were you?

02:50.440 --> 02:51.680
You skipped practice.

02:53.360 --> 02:55.600
There's a new girl… in room B.

02:55.680 --> 02:57.840
-Room B?
-Is she hot?

03:04.760 --> 03:06.720
Would I be telling you if she wasn't hot?

03:08.560 --> 03:10.560
-[Hok] Let's go.
-What are we waiting for? Let's go.

03:17.840 --> 03:18.880
Is that her?

03:18.960 --> 03:20.280
-Which one is she?
-[Hok] That one.

03:21.560 --> 03:24.200
-[Neung, male friend] Wow!
-[male friend] She's my type.

03:24.280 --> 03:25.720
Exactly my type.

03:25.800 --> 03:27.280
Yeah, what about Nan?

03:28.080 --> 03:29.800
[male friend] No one else matters anymore.

03:30.880 --> 03:32.320
But I saw her first, bro.

03:32.400 --> 03:33.600
-I call dibs that's how it works.
-Hey!

03:33.680 --> 03:35.400
-What the heck?
-[male friend] What's her name?

03:35.480 --> 03:36.760
-[Hok] I'm not telling you.
-[male friend scoffs]

03:38.040 --> 03:40.640
Come on, come on, come on, come on.
Yes, she's looking at me.

03:40.720 --> 03:43.080
-Oh, my god, she's so cute.
-What are you talking about, man?

03:43.160 --> 03:45.360
No, you guys are wrong.
I see her smiling at me.

03:45.440 --> 03:46.560
[all giggling]

03:46.640 --> 03:48.040
[coach] Are you sure of that?

03:50.120 --> 03:51.800
-[coach grunting]
-[Neung] Ow!

03:51.880 --> 03:54.000
Didn't I tell you to practice
free throws, huh?

03:54.080 --> 03:56.560
What are you doing here?
Already good enough?

03:56.640 --> 03:59.120
Aren't you being unfair to your
hardworking teammates? You lazy punks.

03:59.200 --> 04:00.680
[teacher] What's going on out here?

04:02.440 --> 04:04.440
They… they skipped
their basketball practice.

04:04.920 --> 04:06.160
I'm sorry for the noise, miss.

04:07.240 --> 04:08.360
[teacher] I see.

04:08.960 --> 04:10.680
[coach] Come on. Let's go.

04:10.760 --> 04:12.920
[teacher] Everyone, let's continue.

04:13.000 --> 04:15.120
I was just mentioning the temporal lobe…

04:15.200 --> 04:17.640
I-Tim, what was that about?

04:18.120 --> 04:19.720
Oh, you mean those guys?

04:20.279 --> 04:23.280
They're on the basketball team.
They're really funny.

04:23.360 --> 04:24.600
[Taew] They aren't worth it.

04:24.680 --> 04:26.000
Don't talk to them, Nanno.

04:29.320 --> 04:30.680
[Nanno] Do you like them?

04:32.920 --> 04:34.360
They're nice to look at,

04:35.280 --> 04:37.480
but they have way too many fans.

04:38.040 --> 04:39.880
I can't compete with them,
you know what I mean?

04:50.960 --> 04:52.960
[dreamy music]

04:55.360 --> 04:57.760
[panting]

05:01.520 --> 05:03.880
Pick up the pace.
Keep running until I say so.

05:04.440 --> 05:05.400
Hmm.

05:08.640 --> 05:10.320
So why did you skip practice, huh?

05:10.880 --> 05:12.280
[Hok] For a girl.

05:12.360 --> 05:13.360
Hmm.

05:15.760 --> 05:17.280
-Is she pretty?
-[Hok] Yes, she is.

05:17.360 --> 05:19.560
[panting]

05:19.640 --> 05:21.800
[coach] Hok, was this one
of your great ideas?

05:21.880 --> 05:22.720
[Hok] Sorry, Coach.

05:22.800 --> 05:24.680
-[coach] Don't apologize.
-[panting]

05:25.400 --> 05:28.400
Keep it up. You're only halfway finished.

05:28.480 --> 05:29.640
Yes, Coach.

05:30.880 --> 05:32.080
[coach] Go faster.

05:33.200 --> 05:35.840
Oh, my god, that fried rice was so good.

05:35.920 --> 05:38.280
[coach] Come on! Keep it up.

05:42.520 --> 05:43.600
Keep going.

05:45.480 --> 05:47.120
Do you even know her name yet?

05:48.200 --> 05:49.320
It's Nanno.

05:49.400 --> 05:53.080
[upbeat music]

05:54.000 --> 05:58.320
WHO IS THIS NANNO?

05:58.400 --> 06:01.960
THE NEW GIRL IN 11TH GRADE,
CLASSROOM B.

06:02.040 --> 06:06.400
SHE'S CUTE.

06:06.480 --> 06:10.040
YOU CAN ALREADY TELL
SHE'S BITCHY JUST BY HER NAME.

06:10.120 --> 06:12.400
SHE MOVED HERE
IN THE MIDDLE OF THE SEMESTER.

06:12.480 --> 06:14.520
SHE MUST BE TROUBLED.

06:14.600 --> 06:19.040
DID SHE GET EXPELLED
FROM HER OLD SCHOOL?

06:19.120 --> 06:23.680
CAN HER SKIRT BE
ANY SHORTER THAN THAT?

06:23.760 --> 06:26.160
SHE'S SO SEXY.

06:26.240 --> 06:29.800
I WILL BE A GOOD BOY
ONCE I GET TO HAVE SEX WITH HER.

06:29.880 --> 06:32.320
WHICH RHINOPLASTY SURGEON
DID SHE GO TO?

06:32.400 --> 06:35.200
SHE LOOKS LIKE
SHE GOT HER WHOLE FACE DONE.

06:35.280 --> 06:37.920
WHAT'S WRONG WITH YOU?
WHY ARE YOU INSULTING HER?

06:38.000 --> 06:41.280
YOU MUST THINK YOU ARE SO PRETTY.

06:47.680 --> 06:51.440
[school bell ringing]

06:58.240 --> 06:59.320
[Hok] Hey, I-Tim.

07:00.640 --> 07:01.680
[sighs]

07:06.240 --> 07:07.880
-Is this for me?
-Mm-hm.

07:14.560 --> 07:15.840
You're giving me both?

07:15.920 --> 07:17.960
No way. Don't be so greedy.

07:19.680 --> 07:22.040
Listen, you're friends with Nanno, right?

07:22.120 --> 07:23.920
Why don't you give her one
of those for me.

07:28.840 --> 07:29.840
Hey.

07:30.600 --> 07:31.760
What's wrong with you?

07:33.480 --> 07:34.440
[thuds]

07:36.960 --> 07:38.720
Hok asked me to give this to you.

07:42.080 --> 07:44.480
You can eat it. I don't really like it.

07:45.400 --> 07:46.600
I don't want it.

07:48.360 --> 07:50.480
Stop arguing already.
Just share it, all right?

07:51.400 --> 07:53.160
-[Taew] Hmm?
-No way.

07:54.000 --> 07:56.000
I'm not interested in their leftovers.

08:00.040 --> 08:03.080
Well… I'll eat it then.
[chuckles]

08:05.240 --> 08:07.280
It's good that you're not eating them.

08:08.400 --> 08:10.440
Why not? They're good.

08:11.280 --> 08:12.880
You are a little chubby.

08:13.360 --> 08:14.600
You should lose some weight.

08:15.400 --> 08:16.600
[sighs]

08:18.800 --> 08:20.800
[foreboding music]

08:30.640 --> 08:32.919
I think she's cute just the way she is.

08:37.520 --> 08:38.799
-[Taew] Guess what?
-[I-Tim] What?

08:38.880 --> 08:40.679
-[Taew] I just found a shirt.
-[I-Tim] Really?

08:40.760 --> 08:42.240
Yes, I did. It looks awesome.

08:42.320 --> 08:44.520
Which shop was it?
Did they have one for me?

08:45.280 --> 08:48.440
You have no idea how hard it is
to find a shirt in your size?

08:48.520 --> 08:50.080
-[I-Tim] Oh.
-[Neung] Hi!

08:53.440 --> 08:54.480
What's up?

08:57.440 --> 09:00.040
Look at these.

09:00.120 --> 09:03.520
[Hok] These tickets
are gonna get you backstage.

09:04.600 --> 09:07.800
[Neung] These tickets… are really special.

09:10.240 --> 09:12.800
Oh, my god! It's that band Japan!
I want to go. Come on!

09:15.680 --> 09:17.240
Tell us what you really want?

09:20.480 --> 09:22.400
Uh… so…

09:23.840 --> 09:26.560
My parents are out of town
for the weekend.

09:26.640 --> 09:28.040
-Mm-hm.
-We're…

09:28.760 --> 09:30.280
having ourselves a party.

09:31.600 --> 09:33.080
[Hok] We want to invite you two.

09:34.200 --> 09:35.160
And Nanno?

09:35.240 --> 09:36.160
[all] Mm-hm.

09:36.240 --> 09:39.840
Mm-hm. So these tickets
are our bribe to take her to the party?

09:40.320 --> 09:42.680
-No way.
-What made you think that?

09:42.760 --> 09:45.640
No, these tickets are just for you guys.

09:46.160 --> 09:47.280
-[Hok] Yeah.
-Mm-hm.

09:47.360 --> 09:49.240
What happens if she doesn't come
with us, huh?

09:53.160 --> 09:54.280
Are you gonna get us drunk?

09:54.360 --> 09:55.960
-What?
-What? No way.

09:56.040 --> 09:57.800
-What about Nanno?
-Yes.

09:57.880 --> 09:59.320
-Hey! Stop talking nonsense.
-Shut up.

09:59.400 --> 10:01.400
[Neung] I mean, yeah,
the party will be fun.

10:02.120 --> 10:03.600
-[Hok] That's right.
-[Neung] Yeah.

10:04.160 --> 10:05.440
Here, keep them.

10:06.040 --> 10:08.800
Why don't you invite her yourselves?
We're not coming to your party.

10:08.880 --> 10:11.880
That's right. Why don't you try
and think a little? Come on.

10:12.400 --> 10:14.320
-[scoffs]
-So, what? You don't want these tickets?

10:14.400 --> 10:15.440
-[Taew, I-Tim] Bye.
-[Neung] Hey. So…

10:15.520 --> 10:16.960
[disappointed sigh]

10:18.960 --> 10:20.320
I told you so.

10:21.440 --> 10:23.880
Honestly. Aren't you tired of this?

10:23.960 --> 10:26.000
It's always all about her.

10:29.280 --> 10:30.440
Nah…

10:31.320 --> 10:33.040
Aren't you overthinking this?

10:33.520 --> 10:35.320
No, I'm not. No way.

10:35.400 --> 10:37.920
-[Taew] It's not like that.
-Everyone is getting us to get to her.

10:39.080 --> 10:42.320
[school bell ringing]

10:43.440 --> 10:44.960
[Taew] Oh, it's fine. It's fine.

10:46.280 --> 10:47.240
Look.

10:47.320 --> 10:48.960
Good morning, Taew and I-Tim.

10:49.040 --> 10:50.040
[Taew] Hi there!

11:13.280 --> 11:15.240
Serves him right. There he goes.

11:23.040 --> 11:24.760
[Taew] Nanno, do you like him at all?

11:25.520 --> 11:27.800
How about you? Do you like someone?

11:32.880 --> 11:36.920
I used to. No, not anymore.
Guys will always let you down.

11:37.720 --> 11:38.600
[Nanno] Yeah, I agree.

11:43.320 --> 11:44.360
Hmm…

11:45.720 --> 11:47.280
It is a nice flower, though.

11:47.760 --> 11:49.360
You were not nice to him at all.

11:49.920 --> 11:51.840
If you like it so much, you can have it.

11:52.400 --> 11:53.960
Keep it. It's all yours, okay.

11:54.480 --> 11:55.640
I hate flowers.

11:57.040 --> 11:59.360
You do? Why is that?

12:00.200 --> 12:02.080
I don't know. I just do.

12:03.920 --> 12:05.040
[scoffs]

12:07.040 --> 12:10.720
SHE'S SO PRETENTIOUS.

12:10.800 --> 12:13.280
I KNOW EXACTLY
WHO YOU ARE TALKING ABOUT.

12:13.360 --> 12:18.600
SHE SAYS SHE DOESN'T LIKE HIM,
YET SHE STILL FLIRTS WITH HIM.

12:19.160 --> 12:21.160
[foreboding music]

12:26.480 --> 12:28.800
SHE SAYS SHE DOESN'T LIKE HIM,
YET SHE STILL FLIRTS WITH HIM.

12:28.880 --> 12:30.680
SHOULD WE USE
THE WORD "SLUTTY" INSTEAD?

12:30.760 --> 12:33.440
SHE PROBABLY WANTS ALL THREE OF THEM.

12:33.520 --> 12:36.240
DON'T INSULT MY NANNO.

12:36.320 --> 12:37.920
OH, DID YOU HAVE SEX WITH HER?
HOW MUCH?

12:38.000 --> 12:40.000
I DON'T PAY FOR SEX.
SHE'S WORTH 4,000 BAHT, I GUESS.

12:40.080 --> 12:42.120
CAN I ASK FOR A DISCOUNT?

12:42.200 --> 12:44.840
JUST 500 BAHT WOULD BE ENOUGH FOR HER.

12:44.920 --> 12:51.880
YOU CAN GET HER FOR FREE. I HEARD
EVERYONE HAD SEX WITH HER ALREADY.

12:51.960 --> 12:53.160
-[bell rings]
-[Taew] What's up?

12:53.240 --> 12:54.520
[I-Tim] There is a new café.

12:54.600 --> 12:55.840
-Let's go.
-Okay.

12:55.920 --> 12:57.520
Yeah. Let's go.
[chuckles]

12:57.600 --> 12:59.040
[Taew] Nanno, are you coming with us?

12:59.120 --> 13:00.240
-[Nanno] Yeah.
-[Taew] Great.

13:01.640 --> 13:03.000
[Neung] Taew. Hey.

13:03.560 --> 13:04.600
What's up?

13:05.200 --> 13:08.080
I have a test and I don't know anything.

13:08.160 --> 13:09.000
[sigh]

13:09.080 --> 13:11.600
I know you know nothing.
You never study.

13:12.160 --> 13:14.720
I do the best I can. I promise.

13:14.800 --> 13:15.960
-[laughs]
-[sighs]

13:16.600 --> 13:17.840
All right. Sit down.

13:19.880 --> 13:21.080
You can go ahead.

13:22.240 --> 13:24.080
It's fine. We'll wait for you.

13:24.160 --> 13:25.240
Uh-huh.

13:26.200 --> 13:28.360
-Come on, hurry.
-Okay, okay.

13:28.440 --> 13:32.040
I'm curious. How is playing basketball
make you any smarter, huh?

13:32.120 --> 13:33.200
Okay, yeah.

13:35.160 --> 13:36.280
You got it now?

13:38.320 --> 13:40.280
-No.
-[both laugh]

13:41.240 --> 13:43.440
Well, here. Look, this one, right?

13:43.520 --> 13:45.160
The median is this.

13:45.240 --> 13:47.640
After this… Let me jot it down for you.

13:48.120 --> 13:49.160
[Neung] Sure.

13:49.240 --> 13:51.640
If you can do that,
then you will know the method.

13:51.720 --> 13:54.000
You want to divide by 1,000 people, right?

13:54.080 --> 13:55.320
Try to use this formula.

13:55.400 --> 13:58.760
[Taew] It will be 3x multiplied
by 3y plus 32.

13:58.840 --> 14:01.640
Remember to always do it this way.
It'll be much easier.

14:02.560 --> 14:04.680
Now, if you take a look right here, you…

14:05.960 --> 14:07.960
[somber music]

14:28.760 --> 14:31.120
Hey, Taew, you okay?

14:32.360 --> 14:34.040
-[Neung] Taew!
-[I-Tim] Taew.

14:34.120 --> 14:35.120
Wait.

14:52.320 --> 14:54.400
[Taew sobbing]

15:00.880 --> 15:02.600
[whimpers]

15:15.120 --> 15:16.720
[crying]

15:18.800 --> 15:20.640
[crying continues]

15:37.200 --> 15:39.280
[crying continues]

15:39.360 --> 15:40.960
Do you still like that boy?

15:41.440 --> 15:43.120
[sobs]

15:43.800 --> 15:45.560
[I-Tim] I thought
you didn't like him anymore.

15:45.640 --> 15:47.560
[whimpers]

15:48.400 --> 15:51.000
[I-Tim] I mean, really,
what's so great about him?

15:51.080 --> 15:52.200
[whimpers]

15:52.760 --> 15:55.320
He's stupid. Come on, Taew.

15:55.400 --> 15:57.400
[sobbing]

16:02.120 --> 16:04.200
[sobbing continues]

16:06.280 --> 16:09.960
He's not a stupid guy.
He's just not good at Math.

16:13.880 --> 16:15.280
[sniffles]

16:16.120 --> 16:19.400
I just don't know why I love him.

16:24.160 --> 16:26.080
[sobbing]

16:30.320 --> 16:33.240
-You, okay?
-[Taew wails]

16:34.000 --> 16:38.040
[Taew] Don't talk to me.
Go away. I just want to cry.

16:38.560 --> 16:40.920
[sobbing]

16:42.600 --> 16:45.240
Okay. I'll go then.

16:47.520 --> 16:49.600
Come outside
when you're done though, okay?

16:50.880 --> 16:53.560
[sobbing]

17:15.599 --> 17:16.599
[lock clicks]

17:19.359 --> 17:20.480
[door opens]

17:29.080 --> 17:30.200
[I-Tim] Taew.

17:33.040 --> 17:34.560
Let's go to the concert.

17:38.560 --> 17:41.000
[foreboding music]

17:44.920 --> 17:45.960
Hmm.

17:47.200 --> 17:48.200
Okay.

17:49.360 --> 17:52.040
I wanted to see that band for a while now.

17:57.320 --> 17:59.440
[upbeat music]

17:59.520 --> 18:01.640
[all] Bottoms up!

18:06.640 --> 18:07.880
[exhales]

18:08.440 --> 18:10.200
[Neung] How can you drink so much?

18:10.880 --> 18:11.920
Come on.

18:13.280 --> 18:14.600
One more?

18:14.680 --> 18:16.200
[Neung] Oh.

18:19.720 --> 18:20.920
Hey, come with me.

18:21.480 --> 18:22.520
We'll be back.

18:26.680 --> 18:29.320
Taew, why is Nanno
not getting drunk at all?

18:29.400 --> 18:31.640
-The guys will get hammered before she--
-Shh.

18:31.720 --> 18:33.280
Why don't you just shout it to her face?

18:33.360 --> 18:34.480
[Neung] One more?

18:34.560 --> 18:36.360
I think we need a recipe.

18:36.440 --> 18:39.760
Why don't we mix this,
beer, punch, and some vodka.

18:40.680 --> 18:42.960
-[Neung] Wanna try it?
-[Hok] That's right.

18:45.960 --> 18:47.080
Where did you get that?

18:47.160 --> 18:49.680
They're my mom's.
That will really mess her up.

18:53.840 --> 18:55.280
How many should we use?

18:56.000 --> 18:57.080
Let's use a couple.

18:57.160 --> 18:59.480
-Should we add them?
-Yeah, let's add them.

18:59.560 --> 19:02.120
-[rattles]
-[Taew] No, give them to me.

19:02.200 --> 19:03.840
Don't drop them be careful.

19:03.920 --> 19:05.280
[Hok] It's empty.

19:05.960 --> 19:07.120
Snacks are here.

19:07.200 --> 19:08.280
Let's drink some more.

19:08.360 --> 19:09.840
-Refill.
-[Hok] Okay!

19:09.920 --> 19:11.880
-Nanno, give me the glass.
-Here.

19:13.360 --> 19:15.960
[ice clinking]

19:16.040 --> 19:17.400
[Hok] On the rocks.

19:19.280 --> 19:21.560
[Taew] Five pills?
I thought we were using two.

19:21.640 --> 19:23.120
Wanna make sure it works.

19:23.760 --> 19:25.960
-Why do you like drinking?
-[Neung] I don't know.

19:26.040 --> 19:28.880
-Here. Everyone, refill your glass.
-[Neung] Yeah.

19:28.960 --> 19:30.960
-[Taew] Come on.
-[I-Tim] Cheers.

19:32.000 --> 19:33.000
[Taew] Let's do this.

19:33.080 --> 19:35.480
I want to drink this one with Nanno.

19:35.960 --> 19:38.640
-Yeah.
-[all] Great!

19:40.240 --> 19:41.440
[cheering]

19:41.520 --> 19:42.800
Chug it.

19:43.400 --> 19:45.800
[I-Tim, Neung, Hok, male friend]
Chug it! Chug it!

19:45.880 --> 19:48.080
[I-Tim, Neung, Hok, male friend]
Chug it! Chug it!

19:48.160 --> 19:49.040
Whoo!

19:49.120 --> 19:51.320
- [Hok] Whoa! Wow! Chug it!
- [Neung] Chug it!

19:51.400 --> 19:52.960
-[Neung] One more?
-[glasses clink]

19:53.520 --> 19:55.080
-[Taew] Chug it.
-Yes.

19:55.160 --> 19:59.400
-[male friend] Oh, yeah.
-[Taew, Hok, Neung, male friend] Chug it!

19:59.480 --> 20:01.720
[all] Chug it! Chug it!

20:01.800 --> 20:03.080
-Chug…
-[thuds]

20:08.880 --> 20:10.800
Hey! Hey, hey!

20:12.080 --> 20:14.400
[grunts, laughs]

20:15.920 --> 20:16.960
-Wait.
-[Neung] Wait.

20:17.040 --> 20:19.360
Where are you taking her?
Come on. Leave her.

20:19.440 --> 20:20.440
We want to watch.

20:20.520 --> 20:22.120
[Neung] I want to check out, too.

20:22.200 --> 20:24.760
Are you insane?
We don't want to see anything.

20:24.840 --> 20:26.600
You can go anywhere, just not here.

20:27.400 --> 20:28.920
You guys can go after me.

20:29.000 --> 20:32.840
Can I go first? 'Cause mine's
the smallest. Come on.

20:32.920 --> 20:34.800
It's my house.

20:35.840 --> 20:37.720
-I'm first.
-[Neung] Fine.

20:37.800 --> 20:39.320
-[Taew] Just hurry up.
